<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Charity Water Landing Page</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Proxima+Nova:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Proxima Nova', sans-serif;
      background-color: #E1EEF1;
      color: #333;
    }
    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px 50px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
      background-color: #E1EEF1;
    }
    header .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    header .logo span {
      margin-left: 8px;
    }
    header nav a {
      margin-left: 30px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #000;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .hero {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding: 50px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .hero-text {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 300px;
    }
    .hero-text h1 {
      font-size: 40px;
      color: #031B4E;
    }
    .hero-text p {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
    }
    .hero-text p a {
      color: #2E9DF7;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 12px 30px;
      background-color: #FFC907;
      color: #000;
      font-weight: bold;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 18px;
      transition: background-color 0.3s;
    }
    .cta-button:hover {
      background-color: #e6b800;
    }
    .hero-image {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 300px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero-image img {
      max-width: 100%;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #E1EEF1;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #666;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">
      <img src="https://www.charitywater.org/assets/logos/logo-icon-yellow-5eeb93e0538a487d7f1d15060f1e4e5e.svg" alt="charity: water logo" height="30">
      <span>charity: water</span>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#">Take Action</a>
      <a href="#">About Us</a>
      <a href="#">Sign In</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <h1>Give Hope,<br>One Drop at a Time</h1>
      <p>
        <a href="#">Water</a> changes everything. Give the gift of clean, safe water. Your donation directly transforms lives.
        Allow yourself to see the incredible difference you make for those without access to safe drinking water.
      </p>
      <a class="cta-button" href="#">GIVE 💧</a>
      <p>100% of public donations fund water projects, with GPS and photo proof on Google Maps.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-image">
      <img src="https://www.charitywater.org/_nuxt/img/charity-water-homepage-hero-girl.2aa53d7.jpg" alt="Girl drinking water">
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2025 charity: water. All rights reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
